WEBVTT

NOTE Original instrumental music throughout; no spoken narration.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
From a screenshot to a website-copy proposal.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
“Together, toward the future.” What does this company do?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Astra detects the screenshot. Ask with the image attached.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Ask for one headline and button. Do not invent prices or claims.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A local Ollama model responds in about 24 seconds. Wait shortened.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Actual answer: Corporate website creation and improvement for small and medium businesses.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Save the actual answer as Markdown for a proposal draft.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Astra for Mac. Public code on GitHub. Backend and model setup required.
